  "domain": "tier0/export/semantics",
  "description": "Export naming probes P1-P4 and P9 (export-plan-compiler.md section 4, R-085, decision 087): wildcards $mesh, $project, $sceneMaterial, empty $udim and $colorSpace outside a group, groups without a wildcard, nested and unclosed, uvTiles filters and a uvTiles parameter rule on a project without UV tiles, two maps of one name and two names equal ignoring case (sources BaseColor and SpecularRoughness, with a non-colliding control of both). P9's layered-set case is not recorded: the documented API cannot add a stack. Each probe step names an authored export configuration (the recorder's preset uzp_recorder, PNG 16, no dithering, infinite padding, root paths s0 and s1, changed as the probe says); the recorder lists it with list_project_textures and, when that succeeds, exports it, recording Painter's answer or refusal, the directory content and the files.",
